 ("309","FFE","Production — HOUSE performance lighting rig",520_000,450_000,"1","HOUSE SETUP, NOT A TOURING RIG. Every artist brings a different design, so the venue provides house positions, house power and a competent house rig — not a spec that visiting productions will strike anyway. FT Infinity ACTUAL house lighting: 48x Chauvet Colorstrike M $118,616 (LPS) + LED rope $54,060 (Neon Guardians, in dispute) + 164 RGBW pixel bars $7,500 + additional $25,000 = ~$205,000 for an open-air stage. Scaled for a larger enclosed room with house positions on the mounting structure: $450,000. Reduced from $850,000 — the difference is touring-grade inventory the house should not own."),
